cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "inexor"
abstract: >-
  Exactly reversible, compressed-state differentiable N-body: a JAX
  particle-mesh code with fixed-point integer phase space (12 or 6 bytes
  per particle) and a bit-exact-replay adjoint whose memory is independent
  of the number of time steps.
type: software
